(text "ESP32 PIN MAP\nIO13 SENS_EN       out  high = 12 V sensors/valve boost + RS485 + DHT22 + NTC powered\nIO26 PWRKEY_CTL    out  high pulse 100-500 ms = press the modem power key\nIO19 MODEM_RST_CTL out  high = hold the modem in reset (pulse 2.5 s)\nIO16/IO17          modem UART TX/RX (115200, through MMBT3904 level shifters)\nIO35 RI_WAKE       in   low pulse = modem has a message (wake from sleep, ext0)\nIO23/IO25          SMT100 RS485 TX/RX (9600 8E1)    IO33/IO32  7-in-1 RS485 TX/RX (9600 8N1)\nIO27/IO5           valve IN1/IN2 (MX1508)           IO4        DHT22    IO21/IO22  I2C SDA/SCL\nIO34 BAT_V adc (x2)   IO39 BAT_TEMP adc   IO36 CHG_STAT in (low = charging)   IO14 CHG_INHIBIT out\nFree: IO18, IO2, IO12 (strap: keep low at boot), IO15 (strap)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 220 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "28faec8e-0d66-4eea-bc7f-a0b11e160da8"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
